[size=14][b]Rules of the broken world[/b][/size]
These rules keep the game fair and fun. By playing on Project Chaos you accept them. Staff decide every case; punishments go from a warning to a permanent ban, depending on how serious the offence is and how often it happens. This page can be edited by the staff in the admin panel (Pages, "rules").

[b]1. Names[/b]
1.1 Character, guild and house names must not be offensive, sexual, racist, political or religious insults, or pretend to belong to staff.
1.2 No names of real people, brands, or other games' trademarks.
1.3 Staff may rename or lock a character with a bad name.

[b]2. Fair play[/b]
2.1 Do not use or spread bugs, exploits or glitches. Report them to the staff instead; useful reports can be rewarded.
2.2 No cheating programs, bots, macros or modified clients that play for you or give you an unfair edge. The game's own tools (hunt tracker, loot filter, autoloot, auto seller) are allowed.
2.3 Multi-client: follow the in-game multi-client rules. Extra characters get no rewards from bosses, bounties or leaderboards.
2.4 Do not manipulate the leaderboards, the arena rating or the guild siege (trading wins, feeding kills, boosting with alts).
2.5 Season characters must not receive anything from standard characters by any trick.

[b]3. Behaviour[/b]
3.1 Be respectful in every channel, in private messages and on our community spaces. No harassment, threats, hate speech or spam.
3.2 No advertising of other games, servers or websites.
3.3 Do not pretend to be a member of the staff.
3.4 Never ask for, or share, account names, passwords or recovery keys. Staff will never ask for your password.

[b]4. Trading and accounts[/b]
4.1 Selling or buying accounts, characters, items or gold for real money outside the official store is not allowed.
4.2 Scams are your own risk in game, but scams using bugs, fake staff messages or impersonation are punished.
4.3 You are responsible for your account and everything done on it. Sharing it is at your own risk.

[b]5. Player killing[/b]
5.1 Killing other players is part of the game, inside the rules of the server's PvP system and skulls.
5.2 Blocking spawns, quest rooms or boss portals on purpose for long periods to ruin other players' game is not allowed.

[b]6. Staff[/b]
6.1 Follow the instructions of the staff. If you disagree with a decision, appeal calmly on the website or on our community server, never in public channels.
6.2 The staff may change these rules at any time; the version on this page is the one that counts.
